= Meetings of PPKI

Panitia Persiapan Kemerdekaan Indonesia or the PPKI is functioning as the creator of basic law and basic system for the country. It will also decide which one shoild be chosen as the basicc law and basic system. One or more meeting is held after the Independence proclamation, the meetings address and try to resolve the basic questions on the newly formed country Indonesia. Members giving each of their thought, debate is likely to happen during the meetings. Shall Indonesia gets established clearly from the PPKI meetings.

